verses.raw_usfm:
He encircled him with pomegranates;  
\q2 with many golden bells around him,  
\q2 to make a sound as he went,  
\q2 to make a sound that might be heard in the temple,  
\q2 for a reminder for the children of his people;   
\q2

with a holy garment, with gold, blue, and purple, the work of the embroiderer;  
\q2 with an oracle of judgment—Urim and Thummim;   
\q2

with twisted scarlet, the work of the craftsman;  
\q2 with precious stones engraved like a signet, in a setting of gold, the work of the jeweller,  
\q2 for a reminder engraved in writing, after the number of the tribes of Israel;   
\q2
